00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:09.940
Um, so there's a, the basketball games are very complex now.

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:16.880
Um, and I think even, even in like the PS one, PS two eras, uh, there was some in between

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:23.800
complexity as well between what we're playing and what we ended up with, uh, with 2k 22.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:27.320
Um, so I think it's, it's sort of like on a curve.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:34.080
It's just hard for one-on-one to work again when you have this few, these few inputs.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:39.200
