spots with your other. It's almost like, you know, I feel like in the, in the one-on-one mode, the only thing

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:53.360
that's protecting you, uh, you know, Sean, you were saying there's a little like

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:58.580
hand that potentially like that is the trigger for like, if the hand touches the ball, then

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.820
that player gets the ball back or something.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:06.340
