00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.360
uh, to have the ball taken from me.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:12.140
Uh, and it didn't always work successfully, but what I would do is I just kind of have my,

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:18.340
I'd go like sideways with the player so that my back was kind of turned towards whatever

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:22.140
direction they were going and just trying to almost like fake them out, like go in one direction

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:26.160
and then try another direction or, you know, it's some mixture of that.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:32.680
