Two on two.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.420
Oh, two on two.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.000
Uh, yeah, I have a little bit.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:18:02.340
Um, whereas it makes it more fun when you, when you switch over to two on two, um, because

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:08.100
now you have this, this other option, uh, rather than just trying to run around a person,

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.880
uh, run around a computer that knows your inputs.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:18.140
Um, now you can pass, but now passing is a little overpowered because I don't think that

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:21.320
the computer can intercept or even like tip your pass.

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:24.620
Like the ball's going to make it to whoever you pass it to.

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:31.060
Um, so that almost makes it a little too easy because now you're guys in a position where,

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:34.900
uh, the computer can't easily just ghost steal.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:38.960
And now it's really just, uh, you're lining up your shot.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:45.000
Um, and maybe even like getting into a point where you can just dunk it.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:51.240
Uh, so it's, it's more fun, but it's also like it has the opposite problem where now it's

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:56.540
just way too easy. Joe, your silence tells me you might not have tried.

00:18:57.140 --> 00:19:02.920
You know what? I was going to confess to that, but, uh, no, I did not try two player, but I do have a

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:07.340
thought on two player and that is, um, that you want to, right?

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:08.960
Two on two.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.280
Yeah. Oh, two on two.

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:11.260
Right. Yeah. I'm sorry. Yeah.

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:15.140
I actually also obviously didn't play two player, but I, I have thoughts on that too later,

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:16.740
but for now two on two.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.160
Um, so I played a couple of games.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.320
I started out playing as Mr.

