I mean, I get it. It would be kind of distracting.

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.040
It would be so annoying.

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:59.840
To be at, to be running around and having to line up the arrow while you're playing.

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:05.660
But it also does feel like making a shot is a little random.

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.720
