00:22:11.820 --> 00:22:13.500
I think that is what it is.

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:19.660
Like, that's just, I think that's become the, uh, the standard is it's just sort of like

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:27.140
a timing. Uh, you hold down the button, uh, you try and gauge where the apex of your jump is and

00:22:27.140 --> 00:22:28.000
then you let go.

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:32.320
Um, but in this case you have to not let go, but you have to like press it again.

00:22:32.480 --> 00:22:36.600
And I always traveled because of that, because I have terrible muscle memory.

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:40.520
Or I would be trying to steal the ball, which is the same button as jump and shoot.

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:42.300
