00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:44.500
And as soon as I stole it, I'm still ramming A.

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:48.940
So then I would jump by accident, not realize I was shooting and then I would land and then

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:52.540
I'd be traveling. So that was not fun, but that's a little aside.

00:22:52.940 --> 00:22:57.540
