00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:13.680
I wasn't, you know, I wasn't familiar with it.

00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:16.740
I think if you just play enough of around the world, I don't know.

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:19.600
It's crazy to think that like that just leads into a full game.

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:23.840
