00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:38.280
like terrible reflexes, but I could not make these shots.

00:23:38.280 --> 00:23:40.420
And when I did, I just felt like it was just luck.

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:45.300
Like the, the, the randomizer of the arrow is like pure hell.

00:23:45.460 --> 00:23:49.740
Like somebody really, whoever designed that really knows how to do like some kind of form

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:53.960
of random number generating, because that thing never had, it doesn't have a pattern.

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:55.440
It goes all over the place.

00:23:55.780 --> 00:24:00.120
